\HLAClausePlacedBlock{90.000}{165.784}{432.040}{%
  \HLAClauseParagraph{\resizebox{431.977bp}{!}{\mbox{Table 13 shows a partial example of interactions and parameters chosen from the restaurant application}}\newline{}\resizebox{432.040bp}{!}{\mbox{described in 4.2.4. Here, the\space{}\textit{FoodServed}.\textit{MainCourseServed}\space{}interaction has three parameters associated}}\newline{}\resizebox{432.031bp}{!}{\mbox{with it. The third parameter uses a Boolean data type to reflect whether the meal was served in a reasonable}}\newline{}\resizebox{431.989bp}{!}{\mbox{amount of time. In addition, this interaction has been associated with the\space{}\textit{ServerId}\space{}dimension from the}}\newline{}\resizebox{431.960bp}{!}{\mbox{dimension table example in Table 15 as a means of filtering on server identification numbers.}}\newline{}\resizebox{432.018bp}{!}{\mbox{\textit{CustomerSeated}\space{}is an example of an interaction with no parameters; the sending and the receiving of the}}\newline{}\resizebox{241.974bp}{!}{\mbox{interaction is sufficient to convey the necessary information.}}}
}
