\HLAClausePlacedBlock{90.000}{173.764}{432.097}{%
  \HLAClauseParagraph{\resizebox{432.097bp}{!}{\mbox{Table 20 provides an example of how the OMT tables are used to describe the representation of user-}}\newline{}\resizebox{431.990bp}{!}{\mbox{supplied tags by the restaurant federate. In this example, no tags are specified for update/reflect, send/}}\newline{}\resizebox{431.983bp}{!}{\mbox{receive, divestiture completion, or request update. A simple text string is used for delete/remove that}}\newline{}\resizebox{432.074bp}{!}{\mbox{describes the reasons for the action. A priority entry is specified for ownership transfer negotiations (both}}\newline{}\resizebox{431.996bp}{!}{\mbox{divestiture requests and acquisition requests). This entry indicates the criticality of the transfer; a high value}}\newline{}\resizebox{240.632bp}{!}{\mbox{tells the federate to accept or divest ownership immediately.}}}
}
