  {\HLATimes\fontsize{9.960bp}{12.000bp}\selectfont\raggedright \resizebox{431.968bp}{!}{\mbox{\textbf{passive subscription:}\space{}A request to the runtime infrastructure (RTI) for the kinds of data (object classes and}}\newline{}\resizebox{432.005bp}{!}{\mbox{attributes as well as interactions) that the joined federate is currently interested in receiving. However, unlike}}\newline{}\resizebox{432.021bp}{!}{\mbox{an active subscription, this information is not used by the RTI to arrange for data to be delivered, nor is it}}\newline{}\resizebox{432.001bp}{!}{\mbox{used to tell publishing joined federates that another joined federate is subscribing to that data (by way of}}\newline{}\resizebox{432.033bp}{!}{\mbox{\textit{Start/Stop Registration},\space{}\textit{Turn On/Off Updates,}\space{}or\space{}\textit{Turn On/Off Interactions}\space{}service invocations). This form}}\newline{}\resizebox{310.420bp}{!}{\mbox{of subscription is provided to support certain types of logger joined federates.}}\par}
}
