  {\HLATimes\fontsize{9.960bp}{12.000bp}\selectfont\raggedright \resizebox{431.993bp}{!}{\mbox{\textbf{range:}\space{}A subset of a dimension, defined by an ordered pair of values, the first being the range lower bound}}\newline{}\resizebox{432.061bp}{!}{\mbox{and the second being the range upper bound. This pair of values defines a semi-open interval [range lower}}\newline{}\resizebox{431.850bp}{!}{\mbox{bound, range upper bound) (i.e., the range lower bound is the smallest member of the interval, and the range}}\newline{}\resizebox{242.892bp}{!}{\mbox{upper bound is just greater than any member of the interval).}}\par}
