  {\HLATimes\fontsize{9.960bp}{12.000bp}\selectfont\raggedright \resizebox{431.944bp}{!}{\mbox{\textbf{receive order (RO):}\space{}A characteristic of no ordering guarantee for messages. Messages that are received as}}\newline{}\resizebox{432.059bp}{!}{\mbox{RO messages will be received in an arbitrary order by the respective joined federate. A timestamp value will}}\newline{}\resizebox{432.032bp}{!}{\mbox{be provided with the message if one was specified when the message was sent, but that timestamp has no}}\newline{}\resizebox{134.032bp}{!}{\mbox{bearing on message receipt order.}}\par}
