  {\HLATimes\fontsize{9.960bp}{12.000bp}\selectfont\raggedright \resizebox{432.109bp}{!}{\mbox{\textbf{reflected instance attribute:}\space{}An instance attribute that is represented but not explicitly modeled in a joined}}\newline{}\resizebox{431.994bp}{!}{\mbox{federate. The reflecting joined federate accepts new values of the reflected instance attribute as they are}}\newline{}\resizebox{432.015bp}{!}{\mbox{produced by some other federation member and provided to it by the runtime infrastructure (RTI), via the}}\newline{}\resizebox{134.980bp}{!}{\mbox{\textit{Reflect Attribute Values †}\space{}service.}}\par}
